# Fact patterns — final paycheck deadline

Generated from `corpus/gold/fact_patterns.jsonl`. Last day of employment is 2026-03-10 and
the next regular payroll date is 2026-03-20 throughout, so the only thing moving is the
statutory branch.

> Using Legal_types as T
> Using Final_paycheck_acme as F

## FP-040 — Cal. Lab. Code § 201 — wages due immediately on discharge

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp040:
  output computation content F.FinalPaycheck

scope TestFp040:
  definition computation equals
    output of F.FinalPaycheck with {
      -- last_day: |2026-03-10|
      -- separation: T.Separation.InvoluntaryTermination
      -- work_state: T.WorkState.CA
      -- next_regular_payroll_date: |2026-03-20|
    }
  assertion computation.due_date = |2026-03-10|
  assertion computation.pto_payout_required = true
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp040
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp040 ─
│ computation =
│   FinalPaycheck {
│     -- due_date: |2026-03-10|
│     -- pto_payout_required: true
│   }
└─
```

## FP-041 — Cal. Lab. Code § 202 — within 72 hours

```catala
