## FP-044 — handbook § 9.3 base rule — next regular payroll date

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp044:
  output computation content F.FinalPaycheck

scope TestFp044:
  definition computation equals
    output of F.FinalPaycheck with {
      -- last_day: |2026-03-10|
      -- separation: T.Separation.InvoluntaryTermination
      -- work_state: T.WorkState.TX
      -- next_regular_payroll_date: |2026-03-20|
    }
  assertion computation.due_date = |2026-03-20|
  assertion computation.pto_payout_required = false
